Z||000007||1FST2M6||08-27-2001||04:24 PM||||they aren't chrome they are stainless welded to the steel pipe. just like the polished head sheild on the bottom of the GTs bumper. oooh shiney.. contact <A HREF="http://www.engineered.net" TARGET=_blank>www.engineered.net</A>  for 304 stainless tips from 2.25" to 4" with what ever inlet you need. i've got 2.5 in 3.5 out... the shop has en for $20ea plus shipping. lifetime warranty.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1fstmeatsig.jpg">          <BR>www.engineered.net||||reg||1
